If you pray too often or too soon your god will ignore you for some
more time. If he fixes your troubles he looks at your worst troubles
(hunger is not enough). Usually if you don't need the prayer for other
purposes (eg. to save your lifeforce from running out) you may pray
as soon as you become weak from hunger without problem.

